X:1
T:Air (Orchestral Suite No. 3)
C:Johann Sebastian Bach
O:Orchestral Suite No. 3 in D major, BWV 1068, 2nd movement (Air)
N:Popularly known as "Air on the G String" (Wilhelmj's violin arrangement in C major).
N:Melody from the flutetunes.com score and MIDI, transposed down from Bach's D major to
N:F major so it fits the recorder (C4 to Eb5). The MIDI was diffed against this setting
N:note for note, one pass of both repeats.
N:Left out: the two appoggiaturas that are zero-length in the source (bars 2 and 12 of the
N:score) and the trill on the C in the last bar. The appoggiatura in bar 9 is written out
N:as a sixteenth, as the MIDI plays it.
N:Chords derived from the bass line and piano part of the flutetunes.com arrangement.
M:4/4
Q:1/4=50
L:1/16
K:F
